A [[Sentience|sentient]] '''species''' of [[humanoid]]s was native to the [[planet]] [[Vuundalla]]. They had [[Color|pink]] skin, magenta [[eye]]s, and [[hair]] of blue, black, and white shades. During the [[High Republic Era]], the population of Vuundalla was ruled over by a [[queen]] and [[king]], who disregarded the local population in favor of wider galactic politics, such as the [[Starlight Beacon]]. Their son, [[Cyrus Vuundir]],<ref name="Aftershock" /> operated as the [[pirate]] Taborr Val Dorn within the vicinity of the planet [[Tenoo]].<ref name="The Young Jedi" />

